							<h1 class="sow-headline">
						 Prof.Dr.habil. Ilka Agricola  						</h1>
						</div>
</div></div></div></div><div id="pg-2-2"  class="panel-grid panel-no-style" ><div id="pgc-2-2-0"  class="panel-grid-cell" ><div id="panel-2-2-0-0" class="so-panel widget widget_sow-editor panel-first-child panel-last-child" data-index="2" ><div
			
			class="so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base"
			
		>
<div class="siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget">
	<p>I am a full professor of pure mathematics at Philipps-Universität in the charming medieval town of Marburg / Germany.</p>
<p>Our research group <a href="https://www.uni-marburg.de/de/fb12/kooperationen/diffgeoana" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>`Differential Geometry and Analysis´</strong></a> works in a wide range of topics which, beside our core areas, include algebraic topology, harmonic analysis, PDEs, and mathematical aspects of general relativity and gauge theory.</p>
<h4>My personal research interests are:</h4>
<ul>
<li>Spin geometry and Dirac operators</li>
<li>Holonomy theory of connections with torsion</li>
<li>Manifolds with non-integrable geometries</li>
<li>Geometry of homogeneous spaces</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div></div></div><div id="pgc-2-2-1"  class="panel-grid-cell" ><div id="panel-2-2-1-0" class="so-panel widget widget_sow-editor panel-first-child panel-last-child" data-index="3" ><div class="box-blau panel-widget-style panel-widget-style-for-2-2-1-0" ><div
			
			class="so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base"
			
		>
<div class="siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget">
	<h3><span style="color: #ffffff;">Contact:</span></h3>
<p><strong>Ilka Agricola</strong><br />
